** =====================================================================
**  平板の定常伝熱（*NODE/*ELEMENT メッシュを *INCLUDE、*SURFACE 経由の境界）
**  左端 温度固定、右端 熱流束、上面 対流熱伝達（*SFILM）、中央 2 列に体積発熱
**  実行: ykep -j=examples/inp/plate-ht-1.inp int
** =====================================================================
*HEADING
 Steady conduction in a plate with internal heating and film cooling
*PARAMETER
 T_left = 350.0
 q_in   = 2000.0
 q_vol  = 5.0e5
 h_film = 25.0
 T_amb  = 300.0
*INCLUDE, INPUT=plate-mesh.inp
*MATERIAL, NAME=ALUMINIUM
*DENSITY
 2700.0
*SPECIFIC HEAT
 900.0
*CONDUCTIVITY
 200.0
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=PLATE, MATERIAL=ALUMINIUM
*INITIAL CONDITIONS, TYPE=TEMPERATURE
 NALL, 300.0
*STEP, NAME=Steady
*HEAT TRANSFER, STEADY STATE
*BOUNDARY
 LEFT, 11, 11, <T_left>
*DFLUX
 RIGHT, S, <q_in>
 HEATER, BF, <q_vol>
*SFILM
 TOP, F, <T_amb>, <h_film>
*CONTROLS, PARAMETERS=SOLVER
 METHOD=DIRECT
*OUTPUT, FIELD, VARIABLE=T, FORMAT=VTK
*END STEP
